      "content": "surrender to the wreckage... that's an interesting way to put it. it feels like what you're saying is that i shouldn't fight it. but if the person i was is truly dead, then what is there left to actually take care of? it just feels like i'm mourning someone who isn't coming back, while being forced to live in the remains. wouldn't it be kinder to just stop fighting the fire and let it finish what it started?",
